@api = http://localhost:5000
@routeId = QajuQXSQ_-8

### Catalogue
GET {{api}}/api/videos
Accept: application/json

### Packaging runs of one clip
GET {{api}}/api/videos/{{routeId}}/transcodes
Accept: application/json

### Analysis (large: per-frame scores)
GET {{api}}/api/videos/{{routeId}}/analysis
Accept: application/json

### Stored playback benchmarks and their aggregates
GET {{api}}/api/videos/{{routeId}}/benchmarks
Accept: application/json

### Active ladder, HLS master playlist
GET {{api}}/api/hls/{{routeId}}/master.m3u8

### Active ladder, DASH manifest
GET {{api}}/api/dash/{{routeId}}/manifest.mpd

### Source file: size and probed codec (X-Video-Codec)
HEAD {{api}}/api/httprange/{{routeId}}

### Same manifest shaped to the 3G profile (2 Mb/s, 100 ms) as a benchmark run requests it
GET {{api}}/api/hls/{{routeId}}/master.m3u8?bench=manual&net=threeG
